Note: E21 ownership. Temporaries made by a While condition are released every iteration; empty texts are stored.
§1 Let t be "".
§2 Let e be "".
§3 Set e to e followed by "".
§4 While t followed by e is not "aaaa", at most 10 times, do the following.
§4.1 Set t to t followed by "a".
§5 Say t followed by e followed by "|".
